{
  "title": { "zh": "这份输出能回答什么", "en": "What this output can answer" },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "一辆车上的视觉系统同时交出五份输出：一个标签、一组框和三张逐像素图。检查台要把车上各个模块的请求分给它们。",
        "en": "The vision system on a car hands in five outputs at once: a label, a set of boxes and three per-pixel maps. The station must route the requests of the car's modules to them."
      }
    },
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "和前面不同，这里一个请求可以有几份够用的输出，选出其中任何够用的都算对。要看清的是每份输出里的数是什么意思、以什么为单位：「那辆车离我多远」该由哪一份回答？",
        "en": "Unlike before, a request may have several sufficient outputs, and choosing any that suffice is right. What matters is what the numbers in each output mean, and in what unit: which output answers 'how far away is that car'?"
      }
    }
  ],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "0A3",
      "kind": "choice",
      "brief": {
        "zh": "为每个请求选出能回答它的输出，够用的都可以选。",
        "en": "For each request, choose outputs that answer it; any that suffice may be chosen."
      },
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "三张图的格子里都是数：对照图里的物体，猜出每张图的数是编号、类别还是长度。",
          "en": "All three maps hold numbers: compare them with the scene and work out whether each map's numbers are ids, classes or lengths."
        }
      ],
      "judge": { "fields": { "mode": "enough" } },
      "rounds": [
        {
          "items": [
            {
              "prompt": {
                "zh": "路面是哪些像素？",
                "en": "Which pixels are road?"
              },
              "needs": ["class", "region"]
            },
            {
              "prompt": {
                "zh": "每个行人各在哪里？",
                "en": "Where is each pedestrian?"
              },
              "needs": ["class", "location", "instance"]
            },
            {
              "prompt": {
                "zh": "第 2 行第 4 列那个像素处的车，离相机多远？",
                "en": "How far from the camera is the car at row 2, column 4?"
              },
              "needs": ["depth"]
            }
          ],
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "a",
              "label": { "zh": "街道", "en": "street" },
              "gives": ["class"]
            },
            {
              "id": "b",
              "label": {
                "zh": "行人 (1, 1)–(1, 2)；轿车 (3, 1)–(4, 2)",
                "en": "pedestrian (1, 1)–(1, 2); car (3, 1)–(4, 2)"
              },
              "gives": ["class", "location", "instance"]
            },
            {
              "id": "c",
              "label": { "zh": "图 1", "en": "Map 1" },
              "gives": ["class", "location", "region"],
              "image": [[0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0], [0, 2, 0, 3, 3, 0], [1, 2, 1, 3, 3, 1], [1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1]]
            },
            {
              "id": "d",
              "label": { "zh": "图 2", "en": "Map 2" },
              "gives": ["depth", "region"],
              "image": [[30, 30, 30, 30, 30, 30], [20, 6, 20, 9, 9, 20], [5, 6, 5, 9, 9, 5], [3, 3, 3, 3, 3, 3]]
            },
            {
              "id": "e",
              "label": { "zh": "图 3", "en": "Map 3" },
              "gives": ["class", "location", "region", "instance"],
              "image": [[0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0], [0, 1, 0, 2, 2, 0], [3, 1, 3, 2, 2, 3], [3, 3, 3, 3, 3, 3]]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "items": [
            {
              "prompt": {
                "zh": "最近的那面墙离相机多远？",
                "en": "How far from the camera is the nearest wall?"
              },
              "needs": ["depth"]
            },
            {
              "prompt": {
                "zh": "停着几辆车？",
                "en": "How many cars are parked?"
              },
              "needs": ["class", "instance"]
            },
            {
              "prompt": { "zh": "画面里有行人吗？", "en": "Is there a pedestrian in the picture?" },
              "needs": ["class"]
            }
          ],
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "a",
              "label": { "zh": "图 1", "en": "Map 1" },
              "gives": ["class", "location", "region", "instance"],
              "image": [
                [0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0],
                [1, 1, 0, 2, 2, 0],
                [1, 1, 0, 2, 2, 0],
                [3, 3, 3, 3, 3, 3]
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "b",
              "label": { "zh": "图 2", "en": "Map 2" },
              "gives": ["class", "location", "region"],
              "image": [
                [4, 4, 4, 4, 4, 4],
                [3, 3, 4, 3, 3, 4],
                [3, 3, 1, 3, 3, 1],
                [1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1]
              ]
            },
            { "id": "c", "label": { "zh": "轿车、轿车", "en": "car, car" }, "gives": ["class"] },
            {
              "id": "d",
              "label": { "zh": "图 3", "en": "Map 3" },
              "gives": ["depth", "region"],
              "image": [[12, 12, 12, 12, 12, 12], [7, 7, 12, 8, 8, 12], [7, 7, 4, 8, 8, 4], [2, 2, 2, 2, 2, 2]]
            },
            {
              "id": "e",
              "label": {
                "zh": "轿车 (0, 1)–(1, 2)；轿车 (3, 1)–(4, 2)",
                "en": "car (0, 1)–(1, 2); car (3, 1)–(4, 2)"
              },
              "gives": ["class", "location", "instance"]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
